---

# 3. Early Radar source categories

Maintain these categories:

### Core Target Employers

Companies with strong potential relevance to my professional profile.

### Target Employers

Relevant companies where suitability depends on the specific vacancy.

### Watchlist Employers

Companies worth monitoring because of relevant technology, transformation or previous hiring evidence, even if some current vacancies are unsuitable.

### Recruiters & Staffing

Recruitment/staffing companies advertising relevant Swiss roles for clients.

Recruiters must be treated separately from employers.

