* Swisscom

A company should remain monitorable even if a particular vacancy is excluded because of language requirements.

### Fides

Fides has previously advertised roles combining Requirements Engineering and Technical Writing with English and German requirements.

There is real-world information suggesting that actual hiring may sometimes be more flexible than the wording of a vacancy.

**Do not present this as an official Fides policy.**

Keep Fides on the watchlist and evaluate future vacancies individually.

